Third-party fixtures in this directory
=======================================

fw_expansion_card.step
----------------------
Framework Expansion Card enclosure ("FW_EXC_3PARTY_WO_LID_ASM_ST2", Creo
Parametric STEP AP203 export, 2021-04-08), an assembly of 3 solids (one of
them instanced twice) with 107 cylindrical, 12 spherical, 12 toroidal and 8
conical faces plus 64 B-spline edge curves.

