The file is redistributed here unmodified as a test fixture for the STEP
importer (`tests/step_tolerant.rs`): it is the real vendor file that the
tolerant import mode, holes on curved analytic faces and the general
periodic-region parameterisation were built against.

Every other fixture in this directory is hand-authored for this repository
and carries its license.
